    <h1>Contact</h1>
    <p><em>Last updated: 2026-10-23 · Applies to incenseherbs.com and data.incenseherbs.com</em></p>

    <p class="lead">
      LanDeng is the brand of <strong>Zhangjiakou Landeng Technology Co., Ltd.</strong>, a supplier of
      Chinese botanical incense. This page lists the channels we actually use, what to include so an
      inquiry is routed correctly, when you can expect a reply, and the few things we do not do — so
      your message reaches the right person the first time.
    </p>

    <h2>Why people contact us</h2>
    <p>
      Most messages fall into one of four groups. Tell us which one applies, and the inquiry moves
      faster:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Commercial — samples, quotes, wholesale.</strong> For existing products from the
        wholesale range: the materials you are interested in, the format (stick, cone, coil, sachet,
        or raw material), target quantity, and destination country/region.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Commercial — OEM and private label.</strong> For product built to your specification
        (OEM) or an existing product under your brand (private label): your target aroma profile,
        format, quantity, packaging, and any specification you already have. See
        <a href="/oem/">OEM &amp; Private Label</a> and <a href="/private-label/">Private Label</a>.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Editorial — corrections and sourcing questions.</strong> If you spot an error, a
        mis-cited source, a broken link, or a claim you can correct from a primary source, tell us the
        page and the specific sentence. Corrections are handled through the process on our
        <a href="/blog/landeng-editorial-methodology/">editorial methodology</a> page.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Privacy and rights requests.</strong> Access, correction, or deletion requests under
        data-protection law, or questions about a legal page, are handled through the same address —
        see the <a href="/privacy-policy/">privacy policy</a> for your rights and the response period.
      </li>
    </ul>

