    <h2>If you are not sure who to write to</h2>
    <p>
      When in doubt, email <code>landengltd@gmail.com</code> and say what you are after in the first
      sentence — a quote, a sample, a correction, or a privacy request. We will route it from there.
      One address keeps it simple, and it matches the contact published in the site footer, the
      Organization structured data, and the <a href="/about/">About</a> page, so there is a single
      source of truth for how to reach us.
    </p>

    <h2 id="faq">Frequently asked questions</h2>
    <h3>What is the fastest way to get a quote?</h3>
    <p>
      Email <code>landengltd@gmail.com</code> with your material, format, quantity, and country/region.
      A complete brief gets a precise first reply; a bare "what is your price?" needs follow-up
      questions before we can answer.
    </p>
    <h3>Do you have a minimum order quantity?</h3>
    <p>
      MOQ is confirmed per inquiry, not published as a fixed figure, because it depends on the product
      and format. Tell us what you need and we will state the MOQ that applies to that specific item.
    </p>
    <h3>Can I order a sample before committing?</h3>
    <p>
      Yes — a sample is normally the first concrete step, so the product can be verified against your
      brief. See the <a href="/blog/samples-program/">samples program</a> page for how sampling works.
    </p>
    <h3>Is the site itself a store?</h3>
    <p>
      No. There is no online ordering, payment, or checkout on incenseherbs.com. Commercial work is
      arranged by email agreement, as described in the <a href="/terms-of-service/">terms of service</a>.
    </p>

